    "title": "Construction on I-75 could impact motorists in Downriver area - NewsBreak",
    "text": "News-Herald\nwebsite\nDetroit\nConstruction on I-75 could impact motorists in Downriver area\nBy Jackie Martinjmartin@medianewsgroup.com,\n1 days agoSouthbound I-75 near the Downriver area will be closed from Springwells to Schaefer Road starting at 9 p.m. on July 11, until 5 a.m. July 14. The posted detour will be southbound I-75, westbound I-96, westbound I-94 and southbound I-275 to I-75. Fort Street will be available for local traffic...\n3",
